msgid ""
"In order for provisioning Inputs to work properly, be sure to properly "
"set the fields they should filter against. In the screenshot below you "
"can see for a Resource Pool Input I've set the Group, Cloud, Layout, and "
"Plan Inputs that it must be filtered against in order to work. Search for"
